Version: 1.0.0-m5stack1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: CardputerZero Sync <noreply@local>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), libsqlite3-0, libfreetype6
Description: Automatic one-way photo sync daemon and LVGL companion UI for CardputerZero
 Background systemd user daemon (cp0-syncd) and 320x170 companion UI
 (cp0-sync-ui) for syncing photos over Tailscale to a Mac receiver.
